'''Alexston Farmstead''' is one of the many [[farm]]s in central [[Westfall]] that have been taken over by the [[Defias Brotherhood]]. Now, the deadly mechanical [[Harvest Watcher]]s roam the fields, and the Defias have laid claim to the farm.

[[Baros Alexston]], an architect at the service of [[Stormwind City]], hails his humble origin from this very land, where he worked as a young boy.<ref>{{Alliance}} [15] [[Humble Beginnings]]</ref>

